1
00:00:00,698 --> 00:00:02,298
Dad!

2
00:00:02,299 --> 00:00:04,269
(Dr Koothrappali:)Sorry.

3
00:00:04,268 --> 00:00:06,868
(Dr Koothrappali:)I'm sure you won't grow
to hate each other.

4
00:00:06,870 --> 00:00:08,800
(ringtone playing)

5
00:00:10,174 --> 00:00:13,244
(Raj(on phone):)Hey, Leonard. What's up?

6
00:00:13,244 --> 00:00:16,274
(Raj(on phone):)What? How did that happen?

7
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,280
(Raj(on phone):)Yeah, okay.

8
00:00:17,281 --> 00:00:19,211
(Raj(on phone):)I'll be there as soon as I can.

9
00:00:19,216 --> 00:00:21,246
(Raj(on phone):)Sorry. I have to run
to the university.

10
00:00:21,252 --> 00:00:22,282
(Amy:)What's going on?

11
00:00:22,286 --> 00:00:25,216
(Raj:)There's been a problem
with our experiment.

12
00:00:25,222 --> 00:00:27,092
(Raj:)A bird got into the clean room.

13
00:00:28,092 --> 00:00:29,622
(Dr Koothrappali:)You want me
to come?
Uh, no.

14
00:00:29,627 --> 00:00:31,997
(Raj:)You had a long flight.
You stay here and relax.

15
00:00:31,996 --> 00:00:34,226
"Relax."
Easy for you to say.

16
00:00:34,231 --> 00:00:36,761
(Dr Koothrappali:)Your mother isn't cleaning out
your bank account.

17
00:00:36,767 --> 00:00:41,267
40 years,
the woman never cleaned a thing.

18
00:00:41,272 --> 00:00:43,072
(quietly): You're just
gonna leave him here?

19
00:00:43,073 --> 00:00:45,103
"Relax," he says.
Yup. Bye.

20
00:00:47,645 --> 00:00:50,575
(singing along to music):
♪ Here comes Santa Claus,
here comes Santa Claus ♪

21
00:00:50,581 --> 00:00:52,281
♪ Right down Santa Claus Lane ♪

22
00:00:52,283 --> 00:00:54,913
♪ Vixen and Blitzen
and all his reindeer ♪

23
00:00:54,918 --> 00:00:56,388
♪ Pulling on
the reins... ♪

24
00:00:56,387 --> 00:00:57,817
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I appreciate the ride...

25
00:00:57,821 --> 00:00:59,951
♪ Bells are ringing,
children singing ♪

26
00:00:59,957 --> 00:01:02,627
♪ All is merry
and bright ♪

